# Plugins

Purpose:
  Plugin adapters for external skills mapped to SDDRA chain graph.
  Only general-purpose skills are adapted; domain-specific ones are excluded.

Owns: ./

Rules:
  [PL1] Only general-purpose skills are adapted.
  [PL2] Domain-specific skills are rejected.
  [PL3] External dependencies are not added.
  [PL4] Adapted skills MUST fit SDDRA token budget.
  [PL5] Adapted skills MUST respect human gates.
  [PL6] Plugin adapters MUST NOT introduce project-specific paths.

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @plugin-adapters/brainstorming.sdd
   3  @plugin-adapters/test-driven-development.sdd
   4  @plugin-adapters/systematic-debugging.sdd
   5  @plugin-adapters/writing-plans.sdd
   6  @plugin-adapters/using-git-worktrees.sdd
   7  @plugin-adapters/code-review.sdd
   8  @plugin-adapters/dispatching-parallel-agents.sdd
   9  @plugin-adapters/writing-skills.sdd
   10 @plugin-adapters/verification-before-completion.sdd

